{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06091","headline":"与苏卢二员外期游方丈寺而苏不至因有是作 · 王维","name":"与苏卢二员外期游方丈寺而苏不至因有是作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共仰头陀行，能忘世谛情。\n回看双凤阙，相去一牛鸣。\n法向空林说，心随宝地平。\n手巾花氎净，香帔稻畦成。\n闻道邀同舍，相期宿化城。\n安知不来往，翻得似无生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06091.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06091","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}